listing:   boot.elf alone
toolchain: QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18)
command:   timeout 20 qemu-system-arm -M mps2-an385 -nographic -monitor none -serial stdio -semihosting-config enable=on,target=native -kernel boot.elf
date:      2026-10-09T20:53:29Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 1 (1 = the boot loader reported 'no valid image' through semihosting, as designed)
hardware:  untested on hardware; QEMU mps2-an385, images placed in its code memory with QEMU's generic loader device, no real flash programming
